= The March on Rome

At the end of October columns of Blackshirts converge on Rome. The King refuses to sign the state of siege, and on 30 October Benito Mussolini, a former socialist editor, becomes Prime Minister of Italy. Two years ago the Italian workers occupied the factories of Turin and Milan. [? if bavaria_soviet != 2 : In a Munich beer hall a man named Hitler tells his audience that Germany needs a Mussolini of its own. ?][? if bavaria_soviet = 2 : On the borders of Red Bavaria the nationalist leagues talk of their own march, on Munich. ?]

